# CVEs accepted in the upstream quay.io/keycloak/keycloak image (libraries bundled by Keycloak itself, not by
# this project). Remove each entry once a Keycloak release ships the fixed library (Dependabot tracks the base image).
# Reviewed 2026-09-24 against Keycloak 26.7.4.

# netty-handler 4.1.136 (fixed in 4.1.137): SNI routing bypass. Not reachable: TLS terminates at nginx and
# Keycloak only serves plain HTTP on the loopback interface.
CVE-2026-75595

# bcprov-jdk18on 1.84 (fixed in 1.85): X.509 Name Constraints bypass. Only affects certificate path validation
# (mTLS / X.509 client authentication), which is not used.
CVE-2026-8763

# bcprov-jdk18on 1.84 (fixed in 1.85): denial of service via lazy ASN.1 sequence parsing.
CVE-2026-13506

# mssql-jdbc 13.2.1: false positive, 13.2.1 is itself listed as a fixed version; the SQL Server driver is not used
# (the image is built for PostgreSQL).
CVE-2025-59250
